01:52:59.498 --> 01:53:00.498
I am struggling.

1041
01:53:00.498 --> 01:53:01.498
This is difficult for me.

1042
01:53:01.498 --> 01:53:02.498
This cuts into my flesh.

1043
01:53:02.498 --> 01:53:03.498
This irritates me.

1044
01:53:03.498 --> 01:53:04.498
I actually want to run away.

1045
01:53:04.498 --> 01:53:05.498
I actually don't believe it anymore.

1046
01:53:05.498 --> 01:53:07.498
I can't see this like this anymore.

1047
01:53:07.498 --> 01:53:09.498
No, no.

1048
01:53:09.498 --> 01:53:12.498
Jesus says, why do you think like that?

1049
01:53:12.498 --> 01:53:14.498
It is written, after all.

1050
01:53:14.498 --> 01:53:17.498
Yes, but Jesus, I even struggle with what is written.

1051
01:53:17.498 --> 01:53:20.498
I just can't do it anymore.

1052
01:53:20.498 --> 01:53:23.498
Why do you think like that, says Jesus?

1053
01:53:23.498 --> 01:53:27.498
And I want to bless you at this moment in the name of Jesus.

1054
01:53:27.498 --> 01:53:32.498
That the sting of unbelief goes out.

1055
01:53:32.498 --> 01:53:38.498
That we all may be set free in the name of Jesus.

1056
01:53:38.498 --> 01:53:43.498
To accept Him for who He truly is.

1057
01:53:43.498 --> 01:53:45.498
The risen Lord.

1058
01:53:45.498 --> 01:53:47.498
The King of Kings.

1059
01:53:47.498 --> 01:53:49.498
And what goes through you.

1060
01:53:49.498 --> 01:53:52.498
What has caused struggle.

1061
01:53:52.498 --> 01:53:55.498
To fully believe in Jesus.

1062
01:53:55.498 --> 01:53:57.498
I pray Holy Spirit.

1063
01:53:57.498 --> 01:53:59.498
You know all these souls.

1064
01:53:59.498 --> 01:54:01.498
Myself, everyone.

1065
01:54:01.498 --> 01:54:03.498
You know all these souls.

1066
01:54:03.498 --> 01:54:05.498
All these spirits.

1067
01:54:05.498 --> 01:54:07.498
All these people.

1068
01:54:07.498 --> 01:54:09.498
You know everyone in this room.

1069
01:54:09.498 --> 01:54:12.498
You know exactly where they stand in life.

1070
01:54:12.498 --> 01:54:14.498
Holy Spirit.

1071
01:54:14.498 --> 01:54:18.498
I want to ask you for everyone who is willing in their heart.

1072
01:54:18.498 --> 01:54:20.498
And who is opening their heart at this moment.

1073
01:54:20.498 --> 01:54:23.498
Or in the coming week will open their heart during reflection.

1074
01:54:23.498 --> 01:54:25.498
Holy Spirit.

1075
01:54:25.498 --> 01:54:28.498
Please do a cleansing work.

1076
01:54:28.498 --> 01:54:31.498
Of faith and truth.

1077
01:54:31.498 --> 01:54:33.498
And bless our hearts.

1078
01:54:33.498 --> 01:54:35.498
That we may see it.

1079
01:54:35.498 --> 01:54:39.498
That we will see Jesus for who he truly is.

1080
01:54:39.498 --> 01:54:42.498
The risen Lord.

1081
01:54:42.498 --> 01:54:44.498
Amen.

1082
01:54:44.498 --> 01:54:46.498
Hallelujah.

1083
01:54:49.498 --> 01:54:51.498
End of service.

1084
01:54:51.498 --> 01:54:53.498
We're going home happily.

1085
01:54:53.498 --> 01:54:56.498
Tomorrow there is prayer, right?

1086
01:54:56.498 --> 01:54:58.498
Tomorrow there is prayer.

1087
01:54:58.498 --> 01:55:00.498
So we will see you at half past seven tomorrow evening.

1088
01:55:00.498 --> 01:55:02.498
Everyone.

1089
01:55:02.498 --> 01:55:04.498
Bye.
